-- nothing drawn --
  the target is 8x8, 256 bytes
  every pixel is the clear colour: true
  and nothing else got drawn: true
-- the whole target --
  the vertex buffer holds 36 numbers, six to a vertex
  green pixels: 64 of 64
  no pixel is anything but green or the clear colour: true
-- the top half, which is where y=+1 lands --
  green pixels: 32 of 64
  row 0 is green: true
  row 7 is not: true
-- a uniform the shader multiplies by --
  green pixels at half scale: 16 of 64
  the corner is empty: true
  the centre is not: true
-- blending --
  green at alpha 0 over red leaves red: rgba(255,0,0,255)
  green at alpha 1 over red covers it: rgba(0,255,0,255)
  green added to red is both: rgba(255,255,0,255)
-- refusals --
  drawing with a pipeline nobody built refused: wrong_moment
  drawing with no pipeline set refused: wrong_moment
  building a pipeline with no vertex layout refused: wrong_moment
  five numbers in one attribute refused: out_of_range
  changing a pipeline after it is built refused: wrong_moment
  writing past the end of a buffer refused: out_of_range
  writing before the start of one refused: out_of_range
  running a pass twice refused: wrong_moment
  drawing into a pass that already ran refused: stale_handle
  a shader that does not compile: shader_refused
  and it said why: true
  a function name that is not in the shader: no_such_function
  a language this host does not speak: unsupported
drove=true
